  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/567/title.png\" width=\"1129\" height=\"399\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FurtiTwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/985/youtube-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3fGJwJqzu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/987/discord-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffurtitwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/988/donate-png.png\" width=\"22%\" height=\"22%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furti_two/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/986/curseforge-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ffurti-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/984/modrinth-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><br><br><strong style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreatorshop.fr%252fen%252fcollections%252funusual-squad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1654/738/image_2026-04-28_231007086-png.png\" width=\"762\" height=\"209\"></a></strong></p><p><strong style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:left\">Nether's Exotism 是一個 Mod，加入了五種現實世界中存在的異國水果，每個地獄生態域都有一種水果。你可以直接食用這些水果並獲得一些特殊效果，但也可以用它們來做其他事情...</strong><br><br>我是法國人，這個 Mod 是用 Mcreator 製作的（如果英文有錯誤請見諒 😅）<br><br><span><span><iframe style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YEi8VP1Sy-Y?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br>以下是 Nether Exoticism 加入的五種水果：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fJabuticaba\" rel=\"nofollow\">嘉寶果</a>（生成於玄武岩三角洲，給予「治癒」效果）、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fCucumis_metuliferus\" rel=\"nofollow\">刺角瓜</a>（生成於扭曲森林，給予「抗火」效果）、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fRambutan\" rel=\"nofollow\">紅毛丹</a>（生成於地獄荒原，給予「恢復」效果）、<a rel=\"nofollow\">佛手柑</a>（生成於靈魂砂谷，給予「夜視」效果），以及<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fPitaya\" rel=\"nofollow\">火龍果</a>（生成於緋紅森林，給予「凋零治癒」效果）！<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/568/image1.png\" width=\"1129\" height=\"286\"><br><br>你可以製作方塊，用來儲存或裝飾<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/569/image2.png\" width=\"1129\" height=\"286\"><br><br><br>Nether's Exoticism 加入了一種能與蠑螈匹敵的生物：<strong>摩洛可</strong>，也就是魔蜥！這個小生物可以透過村民神職人員的交易或地獄堡壘的寶箱獲得。你可以用桶子裝起來帶到任何地方，但小心別攻擊牠，否則會受傷！牠喜歡吃小型節肢動物，例如蜘蛛、蠹魚、終界蟎，也喜歡吃史萊姆或岩漿立方怪。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/570/image3.png\" width=\"1129\" height=\"510\"><br><br><br>以下是果樹：<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/571/image4.png\" width=\"1129\" height=\"735\"><br><br>&nbsp;<br><br>嘉寶果和紅毛丹的樹木可以像木材一樣製作木材、門、半磚、階梯等。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/572/image5.png\" width=\"1129\" height=\"510\"><br><br>&nbsp;<br><br>用紅毛丹可以製作頭盔和盾牌，能對周圍的實體造成傷害。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/573/image6.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"509\"><br><br>&nbsp;<br><br>你還可以用水果做很多其他事情。用刺角瓜可以製作一套護甲和工具，自動烹煮你破壞的任何方塊。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/574/image7.png\" width=\"1129\" height=\"510\"><br><br>&nbsp;<br><br>用嘉寶果果醬可以釀造新的藥水！（凋零治癒、抗火、飽食和夜視）<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/575/image8.png\" width=\"1079\" height=\"617\"><br><br>Nether's Exoticism 與 Create 模組相容，所以你可以將嘉寶果汁儲存在儲罐中，用壓縮機壓縮嘉寶果來製作果汁，玻璃瓶可以裝果汁來製作果醬。<br><br>&nbsp;<br><br>這個 Mod 也與 Farmer's Delight 相容，因此刺角瓜、佛手柑和火龍果可以切割成刺角瓜片、佛手柑碎塊和火龍果塊。另外還加入了怪奇水果沙拉，結合了每種水果的不同效果。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/576/image9.png\" width=\"741\" height=\"414\">&nbsp;<br><br>Nether's Exoticism 樂高套組：<strong>果醬小屋</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1027/283/unknown-4.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<strong>魔蜥陷阱：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1027/282/moloch_trap_3.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br>你可以將 Nether's Exoticism 放入你的模組包中！<br><br></p><div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">你也可以看看我的其他模組：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useless-sword\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/416/64/64/637746702745178325.png\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutated-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1070/646/64/64/638606054091700999.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/588/64/64/637853847063684188.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/657/638184557398425576.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/organics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/413/64/64/637746699816017646.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slimy-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1076/873/64/64/638614825744489631.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/724/578/64/64/638077506455486007.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frosted-friends\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/411/64/64/637746696852738455.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wandering-bags\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/689/759/64/64/638069994452394564.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-torpedoes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/674/64/64/638476410476119618.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/depth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/720/638184653709126308.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-of-yucutan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1002/886/64/64/638523299285638581.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/779/326/64/64/638124003553252444.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sons-of-sins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/109/sons_of_sins_logo_bis.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-confectionery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1158/779/64/64/638727280864889757.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1158/714/64/64/638727221391013276.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-logistics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1116/69/64/64/638670333200272317.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-weight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/734/378/64/64/638084439152506136.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/774/64/64/638476553282271633.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ninjaxxs-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/549/392/64/64/637886561525247638.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fuzes-relics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/580/980/64/64/637945482784615684.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-</p>\n</div>",
